confirm_push.description:
The connection test to {address} succeeded in push mode: the unit never answered our reads with base data, but it answers each poll request with a live-data report that the integration reads — push mode sends one read request per poll cycle and reads the unit's block answer.

In push mode, only monitoring entities are available — the temperature sensors appear once the captured values are confirmed below (or later in the options). The climate appears as a read-only mirror of the unit's state once the power/mode calibration is confirmed below (or later in the options); climate control (writes), the fault code and the firmware version stay absent until the unit answers requests again.

